### 1. CEK SEMUA PAKET INTERNET (GET)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. UPDATE PAKET & FOTO GAMBAR (PUT)
# Menguji apakah url_gambar dan deskripsi tersimpan ke database MySQL
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/products/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_paket": "gaming (20 Mbps)",
  "kecepatan_mbps": 20,
  "harga": 750000,
  "deskripsi": "Paket internet gaming super stabil low latency.",
  "url_gambar": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/7915575/pexels-photo-7915575.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600"
}

###

### 3. TES GANTI KATA SANDI USER (POST)
# Menguji kecocokan password lama dan enkripsi password baru
POST http://localhost:8000/api/customer/change-password
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 3,
  "password_lama": "Hamzah321",
  "password_baru": "Hamzah123"
}

###

### 4. CEK PROFIL CUSTOMER (GET)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/customer/profile/3
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. CEK DAFTAR PELANGGAN ADMIN (GET)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### 6. TES LOGIN PENGGUNA (POST)
# Menguji apakah autentikasi berhasil dan mengembalikan token serta role
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Hamzahgtg@gmail.com",
  "password": "Hamzah123"
}

###

### 7. TES REGISTRASI PELANGGAN BARU (POST)
# Menguji pembuatan akun user sekaligus otomatis masuk ke tabel customers
POST http://localhost:8000/api/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rian Pratama",
  "email": "rian.pratama@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "081298765432",
  "address": "Jl. Danau Sentarum No. 12, Pontianak",
  "product_id": 2
}

###

### 8. CEK STATISTIK DASHBOARD ADMIN (GET)
# Menguji data ringkasan pelanggan aktif, total pendapatan, dan grafik
GET http://localhost:8000/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. CEK MUTASI TRANSAKSI ADMIN (GET)
# Menguji apakah semua riwayat pembayaran tagihan masuk ke mutasi
GET http://localhost:8000/api/mutasi
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. CEK RIWAYAT MUTASI / TAGIHAN MILIK CUSTOMER (GET)
# Menguji tagihan khusus untuk customer ID 3 (Hamzah)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/customer/mutasi/3
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. CEK NOTIFIKASI ADMIN (GET)
# Menguji notifikasi saat ada pendaftaran customer baru atau pembayaran
GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/notifications
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. CEK NOTIFIKASI CUSTOMER (GET)
# Menguji notifikasi tagihan atau status aktif untuk customer ID 3
GET http://localhost:8000/api/customer/notifications/3
Accept: application/json

### 13. TRANSAKSI BARU: BUAT TAGIHAN / BELI VIA QRIS (POST)
# Menguji tombol "Beli QRIS" di kartu paket internet
POST http://localhost:8000/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 3,
  "product_id": 2,
  "total_tagihan": 750000,
  "nama_produk": "gaming (20 Mbps)",
  "metode_pembayaran": "QRIS"
}

###

### 14. CEK STATUS PEMBAYARAN QRIS / INVOICE (POST)
# Menguji halaman Pindai QRIS (apakah status tagihan sudah PAID / PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/invoices/check-status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoice_id": 1
}

###

### 15. ADMIN: TAMBAH PELANGGAN BARU SECARA MANUAL (POST)
# Menguji modal "Tambah Pelanggan" di menu Kelola Pelanggan Admin
POST http://localhost:8000/api/customers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Doni Pratama",
  "no_wa": "085211223344",
  "product_id": 1,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 16. ADMIN: EDIT DATA PELANGGAN (PUT)
# Menguji tombol Edit data pelanggan (misal: ubah nomor HP atau status ke ISOLIR/SUSPEND)
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/customers/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Budi Santoso",
  "no_wa": "081234567890",
  "product_id": 2,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 17. ADMIN: TAMBAH PAKET INTERNET BARU (POST)
# Menguji tombol Floating Action Button "Tambah Paket" di Katalog
POST http://localhost:8000/api/products
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_paket": "Paket WFH Hemat",
  "kecepatan_mbps": 15,
  "harga": 185000,
  "deskripsi": "Paket hemat untuk meeting daring dan kerja dari rumah.",
  "url_gambar": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/4009402/pexels-photo-4009402.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600"
}

###

### 18. TANDAI NOTIFIKASI SUDAH DIBACA (POST)
# Menguji saat pengguna membuka/membersihkan lonceng notifikasi
POST http://localhost:8000/api/notifications/mark-read
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 3,
  "is_admin": false
}